  "reasoning": "The defendant Qin manufactured and sold counterfeit leather bags bearing the registered trademark “ISSEYMIYAKE” without the trademark owner's permission, for profit. This constitutes the crime of infringing the exclusive right to a registered trademark under Chinese criminal law (often termed “侵犯注册商标专用权” or “假冒注册商标罪”). No other distinct crimes are described. Therefore the appropriate charge is a single offense of trademark infringement.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]侵犯注册商标专用权<eoa>"
